Scope of this licence
---------------------

The MIT licence below covers the ORIGINAL WORK in this repository: the source code, the game design
documents under docs/, the content tables under docs/design/catalogs and src/content/data, the authored
SVG glyphs under public/art/icons, and the two generated scenes under public/art/map and public/art/ui.

It does NOT cover, and cannot cover, the Pokémon material this fan project uses: the Pokémon names,
artwork, sprites, item renders, badges, trainer sprites and battle backgrounds under public/art. Those are
the property of Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc., are included here on non-commercial fan-work
terms only, and must be removed or replaced before any reuse of this code that is not itself a free,
non-commercial fan work. Provenance for every third-party asset is listed in docs/art/ATTRIBUTION.md.

Pokémon Ascendant is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK
inc. or The Pokémon Company.


